<title>UK: All three Brent dates kept - trade.</title>
<headline>All three Brent dates kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>All three Brent dates to be nominated from the paper chain on Monday were kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>Two cargoes were kept by Morgan Stanley and one by Shell UK, they said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
